5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I think we should be careful about sustainability. I'll look into the County grant terms and the endowment, as well as the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure everyone can actually get to the library! I'll check the bus links in the two outer wards and the winter road closures north of the river.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I'll examine the running and equipment lines from last year and the county grant terms and the endowment to see how the money is actually flowing.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. It's better to see what actually worked before we guess.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll check the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I want to know if we have the right people to help.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It seems we have a comprehensive spread of topics. I have no further additions for now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
