12,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I'm excited to see what we find out.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
13,1,2,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
14,1,2,pass,George,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
15,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm curious if anyone else thinks the current room bookings are a bottleneck, but I'll stick with my choices for now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
16,1,2,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
17,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think the choices we have are enough for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
18,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
19,1,3,talk,George,,"Since everyone has already committed to their research and indicated they are satisfied, I believe we can move forward to the investigation phase.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
